This repository distributes modifications to CWatM (Community Water Model)
under the GNU General Public License version 3 only.

CWatM is developed by the International Institute for Applied Systems
Analysis (IIASA) and contributors. The integration patch is based on
upstream commit a76ca0b02a99e4a7dadfe1a14fe2ad0b9a282d6c.
The wetland module and accompanying tools were developed in the
CWatM-wetland-module working tree, source commit
55cbb4ac06c06066557f4d8a2135712c6f15b41d.

The dataset providers retain their own rights. Their raw datasets are
not included in the current repository tree. The repository's preexisting
DWES-like files are preserved only in the legacy Git tag/history.
